   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    311.52,
    56.64,
    525.6,
    126.24
   ],
   "id": "e21",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      312.48,
      56.64,
      500.4,
      65.28
     ],
     "text": "a medium large diameter double flower; with"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      312.48,
      66.72,
      502.56,
      75.6
     ],
     "text": "many petals, some arranged in a loose central"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.76,
      76.32,
      478.08,
      85.68
     ],
     "text": "cluster; a bright cherry pink peta! colour"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.76,
      86.88,
      525.6,
      96.0
     ],
     "text": "corresponding to RHS 52A; petal margins with fine,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.76,
      96.72,
      524.88,
      106.08
     ],
     "text": "even serrations; a long thick stem; large foliage; an"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.76,
      106.32,
      511.92,
      116.16
     ],
     "text": "epicalyx with 2 opposite pairs of lobes; and very"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.52,
      116.4,
      509.76,
      126.24
     ],
     "text": "waxy foliage and calyx with a thick wax coating."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "a medium large diameter double flower; with\nmany petals, some arranged in a loose central\ncluster; a bright cherry pink peta! colour\ncorresponding to RHS 52A; petal margins with fine,\neven serrations; a long thick stem; large foliage; an\nepicalyx with 2 opposite pairs of lobes; and very\nwaxy foliage and calyx with a thick wax coating.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
