     "bbox": [
      311.52,
      155.76,
      508.56,
      165.12
     ],
     "text": "but differs in having a petal colour brighter pink"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.28,
      165.84,
      519.36,
      174.96
     ],
     "text": "than that of \u2018Katia\u2019 (50B), more serrated petals and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      311.28,
      175.68,
      397.2,
      184.56
     ],
     "text": "a more waxy foliage."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
